---
// VerificationSection.astro - Réplica exacta del módulo de Claves API & Firmas GPG del screenshot
---

<div class="space-y-6">
  <!-- Section Title Header matching the screenshot layout -->
  <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
    <div>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white tracking-tight">Claves API & Firmas GPG</h2>
      <p class="text-xs text-zinc-400 mt-1">
        Gestiona tus claves API para acceder a los servicios de Antigravity y verifica la autenticidad de los paquetes.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Blue Action Button matching 'Crear Clave API' in screenshot -->
    <button
      id="create-key-btn"
      class="bg-[#0066ff] hover:bg-blue-500 text-white text-xs font-medium px-4 py-2 rounded-md shadow-lg shadow-blue-600/20 transition-all flex items-center space-x-2 active:scale-95"
    >
      <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 4v16m8-8H4"></path>
      </svg>
      <span>Crear Clave API</span>
    </button>
  </div>

  <!-- API Keys Table Container - Replica of screenshot -->
  <div class="border border-zinc-800/80 rounded-lg bg-[#0c0c0e] overflow-hidden">
    <div class="overflow-x-auto">
      <table class="w-full text-left text-xs text-zinc-300">
        <!-- Table Header matching screenshot -->
        <thead class="bg-[#08080a] border-b border-zinc-800/80 text-[10px] uppercase font-mono tracking-wider text-zinc-500 select-none">
          <tr>
            <th scope="col" class="py-3.5 px-6">NOMBRE</th>
            <th scope="col" class="py-3.5 px-6">CLAVE / FINGERPRINT</th>
            <th scope="col" class="py-3.5 px-6">CREADO POR</th>
            <th scope="col" class="py-3.5 px-6 text-right">ACCIONES</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>

        <!-- Table Body matching screenshot content -->
        <tbody id="api-keys-list" class="divide-y divide-zinc-800/60 font-mono text-[11px]">
          <!-- Key Row 1 (Default API Key from screenshot) -->
          <tr class="hover:bg-zinc-900/40 transition-colors">
            <td class="py-4 px-6 font-sans font-medium text-white">Default API Key</td>
            <td class="py-4 px-6 text-zinc-300">
              <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                <span>sk-qfZc...qwLs</span>
                <button 
                  data-copy="key-default"
                  data-text="sk-qfZc9A8B7C6D5E4F3G2H1I0JqwLs"
                  classcopy="copy-btn text-zinc-500 hover:text-zinc-200 transition-colors"
                  title="Copiar Clave"
                >
                  📋
                </button>
              </div>
            </td>
            <td class="py-4 px-6 text-zinc-400 font-sans">user@antigravity-linux.org</td>
            <td class="py-4 px-6 text-right">
              <span class="inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] bg-emerald-950/60 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-800/40">Activa</span>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Key Row 2: Official GPG Release Key -->
          <tr class="hover:bg-zinc-900/40 transition-colors">
            <td class="py-4 px-6 font-sans font-medium text-white">Antigravity Official Release GPG Key</td>
            <td class="py-4 px-6 text-zinc-300">
              <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                <span>4A8F...39E1</span>
                <button 
                  data-copy="gpg-key"
                  data-text="4A8F 9C2D 1E4B 3017 FA98 E3B2 C1D0 F97E 6F5D 39E1"
                  class="copy-btn text-zinc-500 hover:text-zinc-200 transition-colors"
                  title="Copiar GPG Key Fingerprint"
                >
                  📋
                </button>
              </div>
            </td>
            <td class="py-4 px-6 text-zinc-400 font-sans">security@antigravity-linux.org</td>
            <td class="py-4 px-6 text-right">
              <span class="inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] bg-blue-950/60 text-blue-400 border border-blue-800/40">Firma RSA 4096</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Verification Instructions Panel -->
  <div class="border border-zinc-800/80 rounded-lg bg-[#0c0c0e] p-5 space-y-3">
    <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Verificación de Integridad mediante GPG y SHA-256</h3>
    <p class="text-xs text-zinc-400">
      Para comprobar que el paquete descargado no ha sido modificado, ejecuta en tu terminal:
    </p>

    <div class="bg-[#050507] border border-zinc-800/90 rounded p-3 font-mono text-[11px] text-zinc-300 space-y-1">
      <p class="text-zinc-500"># 1. Verificar hash SHA-256</p>
      <p class="text-emerald-400">sha256sum -c antigravity_1.4.0_amd64.deb.sha256</p>
      <p class="text-zinc-500"># 2. Verificar firma GPG</p>
      <p class="text-emerald-400">gpg --verify antigravity_1.4.0_amd64.deb.asc</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
